IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rtsa-public`

-- Rapid Transit Systems Act 1995, ss 12, 21B, 21F, 21G, 21R, 23A, 23B, 25 to 27, 39 and 44 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_rapid-transit-systems-act-1995.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

